1
00:01:09,350 --> 00:01:14,820
[Connecting to You]

2
00:01:17,610 --> 00:01:18,730
Ever since I was a kid,

3
00:01:18,730 --> 00:01:21,740
my world was a bit different
from everyone else's.

4
00:01:22,650 --> 00:01:24,380
When I was a kid, I drew pictures

5
00:01:24,380 --> 00:01:27,390
where everyone had  threads coming out
of their heads.

6
00:01:28,690 --> 00:01:30,250
Later, I realized

7
00:01:30,560 --> 00:01:33,460
it was the emotional connections
between people.

8
00:01:35,259 --> 00:01:36,490
Every connection

9
00:01:36,520 --> 00:01:37,920
grows into a thread.

10
00:01:39,560 --> 00:01:43,229
Different feelings
grow different colored threads.

11
00:01:43,560 --> 00:01:47,360
Right, the red ones are the love
connections we all understand best.

12
00:01:49,910 --> 00:01:51,360
As for the blue ones,

13
00:01:51,380 --> 00:01:54,410
