is a bit tense.

14
00:01:57,009 --> 00:02:00,470
Even though
I can see these threads,

15
00:02:00,970 --> 00:02:03,890
I haven't formed
a connection with anyone.

16
00:02:05,040 --> 00:02:06,480
Not a single one.

17
00:02:08,669 --> 00:02:13,670
Or maybe I do have connections with others,
but I just can't see them?

18
00:02:19,930 --> 00:02:21,050
I believe

19
00:02:21,070 --> 00:02:24,180
there must be someone
in this world connected to me.

20
00:02:26,540 --> 00:02:28,480
So I tried hard to help others,

21
00:02:28,510 --> 00:02:30,329
hoping to find my own threads.

22
00:02:31,620 --> 00:02:34,350
But I've also gotten myself
into a lot of trouble.

23
00:02:51,160 --> 00:02:54,510
[If you don't reply,
you'll never see me again.]

24
