or difficulties along the way.

275
00:14:29,060 --> 00:14:32,670
You might need to build
more trust between you.

276
00:14:34,010 --> 00:14:37,170
That way, you'll have a chance
to get through them

277
00:14:37,200 --> 00:14:39,130
and keep moving forward together.

278
00:14:39,550 --> 00:14:42,130
So you mean we are true love?

279
00:14:42,690 --> 00:14:44,360
Yes. You two are true love.

280
00:14:44,600 --> 00:14:47,800
Thanks! I feel confident
about this relationship again.

281
00:14:48,260 --> 00:14:49,220
How much is it?

282
00:14:49,240 --> 00:14:50,240
Three hundred.

283
00:14:52,350 --> 00:14:53,920
Thank you.
I'll come back if I have more questions.

284
00:14:53,920 --> 00:14:55,600
Okay, bye-bye.

285
00:14:55,880 --> 00:14:57,630
Take care. Come back anytime.

286
00:14:58,580 --> 00:15:01,620
Why tell her so much? We've got her money.

287
00:15:08,020 --> 00:15:09,490
Damn.

288
00:15:09,880 --> 00:15:10,690
That guy Danny

289
00:15:10,720 --> 00:15:13,880
is dating a junior
from the Foreign Languages Department.

290
00:15:13,880 --> 00:15:14,580
Tell me.

291
00:15:14,870 --> 00:15:19,540
Why don't Tong, Xuan,
and Yilin from the club

292
00:15:20,760 --> 00:15:22,480
like me?

293
00:15:23,080 --> 00:15:26,500
I'm pretty sure all three
of their threads with you are yellow.

294
00:15:26,500 --> 00:15:28,370
Pure yellow.

295
00:15:31,320 --> 00:15:33,140
I really want to be in a relationship.

296
00:15:33,140 --> 00:15:35,490
I think you should break that bad habit

297
00:15:35,520 --> 00:15:38,120
of falling for everyone you see.

298
00:15:45,180 --> 00:15:46,310
Wait a minute.

299
00:15:46,330 --> 00:15:48,230
I saw a news report...

300
00:15:48,260 --> 00:15:51,090
about Officer Wu Dawei.

301
00:15:51,370 --> 00:15:53,380
The one who called you
a pervert last time.

302
00:15:53,380 --> 00:15:55,330
The police have now obtained

303
00:15:55,290 --> 00:15:58,300
[Live]

304
00:15:55,360 --> 00:15:58,000
a complete list of the cash
taken from the victims,

305
00:15:58,000 --> 00:15:59,310
along with evidence documenting

306
00:15:59,310 --> 00:16:01,820
the temple's scam operation.

307
00:16:01,970 --> 00:16:04,680
We investigate cases based on evidence.

308
00:16:04,700 --> 00:16:06,040
So, in principle, we do not
believe in ghosts, gods,

309
00:16:06,040 --> 00:16:07,870
the Third Eye, or Psychic Abilities.

310
00:16:07,870 --> 00:16:09,420
He's talking about you.

311
00:16:09,450 --> 00:16:11,870
No wonder we can't stand each other.

312
00:16:14,370 --> 00:16:16,780
Do you know how outrageous
that temple priest was?

313
00:16:16,780 --> 00:16:18,460
I just transferred him
to the District Prosecutors Office.

314
00:16:18,460 --> 00:16:21,320
I saw some people trying
to beat him up on the street.

315
00:16:21,340 --> 00:16:22,900
He scammed people out of several million,

316
00:16:22,900 --> 00:16:24,310
so I guess it's understandable
that people wanted to beat him up.

317
00:16:24,310 --> 00:16:26,730
I also heard about a woman
who ran a small restaurant by herself

318
00:16:26,730 --> 00:16:28,470
and worked hard to raise three children.

319
00:16:28,470 --> 00:16:29,870
She withdrew all her savings
and gave it to the temple priest

320
00:16:29,870 --> 00:16:32,470
because she wanted
to pray for a good marriage.

321
00:16:32,480 --> 00:16:33,850
Isn't that pitiful?

322
00:16:36,500 --> 00:16:38,700
I don't think those people need sympathy.

323
00:16:38,700 --> 00:16:40,430
They need to think rationally.

324
00:16:40,440 --> 00:16:42,810
They should take this opportunity
to stop being so superstitious.

325
00:16:42,810 --> 00:16:45,880
Otherwise, sooner or later,
they'll get scammed again.

326
00:16:45,880 --> 00:16:46,920
Dawei,

327
00:16:46,950 --> 00:16:49,830
talking to a cold-blooded
rational person like you

328
00:16:49,890 --> 00:16:51,290
is really boring.

329
00:16:51,570 --> 00:16:52,490
Exactly.

330
00:16:54,490 --> 00:16:57,450
Officer, I want to report a case.

331
00:17:03,290 --> 00:17:05,579
[Psychic]
[Consultations and Finding People]

332
00:17:05,869 --> 00:17:07,210
Why him?

333
00:17:07,530 --> 00:17:08,650
Sit here?

334
00:17:08,730 --> 00:17:12,829
[Psychic]
[Consultations and Finding People]

335
00:17:08,960 --> 00:17:10,369
Sit wherever you like.

336
00:17:12,869 --> 00:17:14,500
How can I help you?

337
00:17:14,960 --> 00:17:18,200
I want to ask about my love life.

338
00:17:21,470 --> 00:17:23,859
You want to ask about your love life?

339
00:17:24,240 --> 00:17:25,510
Is that not okay?

340
00:17:26,440 --> 00:17:27,210
Of course it is.

341
00:17:27,210 --> 00:17:28,310
Yes, it's okay.

342
00:17:29,430 --> 00:17:31,330
I heard you're pretty accurate.

343
00:17:32,660 --> 00:17:35,660
I am, but wait a moment.

344
00:17:38,500 --> 00:17:39,800
What's going on?

345
00:17:40,230 --> 00:17:42,750
He said on TV that he doesn't believe
in ghosts or people with the Third Eye.

346
00:17:42,750 --> 00:17:45,260
And now he's here asking for a reading.
What's wrong with him?

347
00:17:45,260 --> 00:17:47,550
Maybe he's here to challenge me?

348
00:17:47,580 --> 00:17:49,420
Or he just doesn't like me?

349
00:17:49,450 --> 00:17:51,270
Maybe he wants to test my abilities?

350
00:17:51,270 --> 00:17:54,080
No, I think
he totally believes in this stuff.

351
00:17:54,100 --> 00:17:56,310
He's just pretending to be
all rational and scientific.

352
00:17:56,310 --> 00:17:58,120
He doesn't have a red thread at all.

353
00:17:58,120 --> 00:18:00,540
He looks like an idiot.
Just make something up.

354
00:18:00,540 --> 00:18:02,340
He'll believe anything anyway.

355
00:18:03,030 --> 00:18:04,090
Is that okay?

356
00:18:04,120 --> 00:18:05,150
Of course.

357
00:18:05,180 --> 00:18:05,810
Smile.

358
00:18:10,190 --> 00:18:10,910
Done discussing?

359
00:18:10,910 --> 00:18:12,150
Done.

360
00:18:13,470 --> 00:18:17,060
Did you bring a photo of you
and your girlfriend?

361
00:18:17,090 --> 00:18:17,780
Yes.

362
00:18:20,650 --> 00:18:22,000
She is my girlfriend.

363
00:18:22,490 --> 00:18:24,770
But recently she said
she wants to break up.

364
00:18:24,770 --> 00:18:25,900
I'm really worried.

365
00:18:28,610 --> 00:18:31,830
I want to know if we still have a chance
to stay together.

366
00:18:33,120 --> 00:18:34,340
She's your girlfriend?

367
00:18:34,340 --> 00:18:34,950
Yes.

368
00:18:35,000 --> 00:18:36,000
Are you sure?

369
00:18:36,750 --> 00:18:38,440
Why would I ask you that otherwise?

370
00:18:38,440 --> 00:18:40,070
Right, you dummy.

371
00:18:40,710 --> 00:18:42,000
Sorry.

372
00:18:44,370 --> 00:18:46,410
After looking at it, I think

373
00:18:46,720 --> 00:18:50,440
your relationship
with your girlfriend is pretty ordinary.

374
00:18:51,990 --> 00:18:53,360
I suggest you two

375
00:18:53,890 --> 00:18:54,990
go on more dates

376
00:18:56,050 --> 00:18:58,590
and see if you can bring back

377
00:18:58,770 --> 00:19:00,270
the spark.

378
00:19:00,380 --> 00:19:02,960
Yes, spend more time together.

379
00:19:03,830 --> 00:19:05,100
So,

380
00:19:06,630 --> 00:19:09,090
you think we're a suitable couple?

381
00:19:10,470 --> 00:19:12,770
A perfect match. Totally.

382
00:19:13,040 --> 00:19:13,880
Lin Jiakai.

383
00:19:14,480 --> 00:19:16,110
Jiang Chaonan.

384
00:19:17,030 --> 00:19:18,770
You're suspected of being involved
in a fraud scheme.

385
00:19:18,770 --> 00:19:21,100
Please come with me to the police station.

386
00:19:21,350 --> 00:19:22,720
No.

387
00:19:22,840 --> 00:19:24,900
-We didn't scam anyone.
-I don't know anything.

388
00:19:24,900 --> 00:19:26,400
Do you know Zhang Yujing?

389
00:19:26,430 --> 00:19:27,740
-Zhang Yujing?
-Zhang Yujing?

390
00:19:27,740 --> 00:19:28,950
Yujing?

391
00:19:28,980 --> 00:19:30,010
Yes, Yujing.

392
00:19:30,490 --> 00:19:31,660
You're suspected of helping

393
00:19:31,660 --> 00:19:33,060
a romance scam syndicate

394
00:19:33,060 --> 00:19:35,150
scam Zhang Yujing out of 300,000.

395
00:19:35,180 --> 00:19:37,120
-No.
-300,000? We haven't even...

396
00:19:37,150 --> 00:19:39,310
If you have anything else to explain,

397
00:19:39,330 --> 00:19:40,320
come back to the station with me.

398
00:19:40,320 --> 00:19:41,530
We only charge 300 yuan a time.

399
00:19:41,530 --> 00:19:42,590
Where would we get that kind of money?

400
00:19:42,590 --> 00:19:43,460
I don't have 300,000.

401
00:19:43,460 --> 00:19:44,410
I don't have 300,000 in my account.

402
00:19:44,410 --> 00:19:45,120
How could I?

403
00:19:45,480 --> 00:19:47,260
-Please, you must have misunderstood.
-We really didn't scam her out of 300,000.

404
00:19:47,260 --> 00:19:48,990
It must be a misunderstanding.

405
00:19:51,900 --> 00:19:52,820
Lin Jiakai.

406
00:19:52,850 --> 00:19:54,850
I actually started to think
you were a good guy.

407
00:19:54,850 --> 00:19:56,510
But you teamed up with Jeff
to scam me out of my money.

408
00:19:56,510 --> 00:19:57,640
You really suck!

409
00:19:58,290 --> 00:20:00,970
Who's Jeff? I don't even know him.

410
00:20:01,000 --> 00:20:02,500
How could I have teamed up with him?

411
00:20:02,500 --> 00:20:03,500
Didn't you say last time

412
00:20:03,500 --> 00:20:04,490
that Jeff and I should trust each other

413
00:20:04,490 --> 00:20:06,620
and overcome difficulties together?

414
00:20:08,500 --> 00:20:10,960
I guess I did say that.

415
00:20:10,980 --> 00:20:11,860
Yeah.

416
00:20:12,610 --> 00:20:13,750
The day after you said that,

417
00:20:13,750 --> 00:20:15,290
he said his grandpa's condition
had gotten worse

418
00:20:15,290 --> 00:20:16,290
and wanted to borrow money from me.

419
00:20:16,290 --> 00:20:18,750
So I sent him money
from my mom's account.

420
00:20:18,770 --> 00:20:19,830
And then what?

421
00:20:19,860 --> 00:20:21,500
After getting the money,
he started acting distant.

422
00:20:21,500 --> 00:20:23,300
Now he's vanished into thin air!

423
00:20:26,670 --> 00:20:28,160
How could it be such a coincidence?

424
00:20:28,160 --> 00:20:29,560
Is it just a coincidence?

425
00:20:29,720 --> 00:20:31,380
Combined with the scam

426
00:20:31,720 --> 00:20:35,750
and the fact that you were suspected
of stalking and sexually harassing her

427
00:20:35,750 --> 00:20:37,040
a few weeks ago,

428
00:20:37,060 --> 00:20:39,290
these two incidents suggest

429
00:20:39,320 --> 00:20:41,920
that you may have deliberately
approached her

430
00:20:41,930 --> 00:20:44,340
with a plan in mind.

431
00:20:45,460 --> 00:20:46,750
Officer.

432
00:20:46,770 --> 00:20:48,980
I said it many times last time.

433
00:20:49,010 --> 00:20:51,530
The rooftop incident
was really just a coincidence.

434
00:20:51,530 --> 00:20:53,180
I was trying to save her.

435
00:20:53,430 --> 00:20:55,040
And as for this reading,

436
00:20:55,140 --> 00:20:56,760
Yujing came to us on her own.

437
00:20:56,780 --> 00:20:58,450
We didn't go looking for her.

438
00:20:59,370 --> 00:21:01,080
Exactly.

439
00:21:01,110 --> 00:21:02,770
You...

440
00:21:07,330 --> 00:21:08,930
Then how do you explain this?

441
00:21:11,610 --> 00:21:12,890
Do you work part-time here?

442
00:21:12,890 --> 00:21:13,970
Yeah, yeah.

443
00:21:14,000 --> 00:21:16,060
-I wasn't talking to you.
-Oh, sorry.

444
00:21:17,240 --> 00:21:20,250
Yes, I do. What's wrong?

445
00:21:20,730 --> 00:21:22,390
This is Jeff's account.

446
00:21:21,320 --> 00:21:23,400
[Check in to get free beer. There are
lots of drinks. Good for gatherings.]

447
00:21:22,410 --> 00:21:23,870
Zhang Yujing said

448
00:21:23,430 --> 00:21:25,550
[But make a reservation first,
or you'll wait too long.]

449
00:21:23,900 --> 00:21:26,130
she found out Jeff
had been to your workplace

450
00:21:25,580 --> 00:21:27,440
[Cute staff. 5 stars.]

451
00:21:26,160 --> 00:21:27,030
twice.

452
00:21:27,230 --> 00:21:30,090
Exactly. Look.
And you still say you don't know him.

453
00:21:31,160 --> 00:21:33,540
He just happened to come to eat.

454
00:21:33,570 --> 00:21:36,490
And he always came on Thursdays.

455
00:21:36,540 --> 00:21:38,750
I wasn't even scheduled on Thursdays.

456
00:21:38,750 --> 00:21:42,150
You won't admit it? You're going
to keep covering for him, aren't you?

457
00:21:42,150 --> 00:21:43,100
Yeah, yeah.

458
00:21:44,970 --> 00:21:46,730
Oh, no, no, no.

459
00:21:47,200 --> 00:21:48,500
Then I'll sue you!

460
00:21:48,520 --> 00:21:49,940
Then you'll have to pay me back.

461
00:21:49,940 --> 00:21:50,610
President.

462
00:21:50,630 --> 00:21:51,720
No, no, no.

463
00:21:51,740 --> 00:21:52,720
There is no president.

464
00:21:52,720 --> 00:21:54,150
Didn't you say you'd take 70%

465
00:21:54,150 --> 00:21:55,460
and I'd take 30% from the Psychic Club,

466
00:21:55,460 --> 00:21:57,530
-so you'll help me deal with these...
-See? He said that...

467
00:21:57,530 --> 00:22:00,280
-Our Psychic Club tells people's fortunes.
-I confess.

468
00:22:00,280 --> 00:22:01,740
I also said it today.

469
00:22:02,030 --> 00:22:03,130
Look, look.

470
00:22:03,230 --> 00:22:04,650
You are dead meat.

471
00:22:05,890 --> 00:22:08,210
Aren't you going to eat
some pork trotters with vermicelli?

472
00:22:08,210 --> 00:22:09,740
It can ward off bad luck.

473
00:22:10,560 --> 00:22:11,980
I'm not in the mood.

474
00:22:13,890 --> 00:22:15,790
They questioned us
for three hours straight.

475
00:22:15,790 --> 00:22:17,720
They didn't even let me take a shit.

476
00:22:18,420 --> 00:22:19,820
So much for human rights.

477
00:22:21,710 --> 00:22:23,910
I told you that cop was annoying, right?

478
00:22:24,220 --> 00:22:26,280
He was stubborn and wouldn't listen.

479
00:22:26,620 --> 00:22:27,750
During the whole interrogation,

480
00:22:27,750 --> 00:22:30,810
he just kept making up
his own version of what happened.

481
00:22:31,640 --> 00:22:32,720
Good thing

482
00:22:32,870 --> 00:22:34,870
you weren't working when Jeff came.

483
00:22:35,500 --> 00:22:38,250
They couldn't find
any suspicious communication records.

484
00:22:38,250 --> 00:22:40,110
Otherwise, you'd be behind bars.

485
00:22:40,430 --> 00:22:41,880
I'm really unlucky.

486
00:22:44,060 --> 00:22:44,850
By the way.

487
00:22:45,870 --> 00:22:47,870
People are saying we're a scam ring.

488
00:22:48,780 --> 00:22:49,780
What should we do?

489
00:22:49,780 --> 00:22:51,910
Should we keep the Psychic Club going?

490
00:22:55,160 --> 00:22:57,360
I guess we can only
put it on hold for now.

491
00:22:58,620 --> 00:23:01,880
I guess I'll have to pick up more shifts
at my part-time job.

492
00:23:14,330 --> 00:23:15,870
Club Darling, help me out.

493
00:23:15,900 --> 00:23:16,880
Help you with what?

494
00:23:16,880 --> 00:23:18,340
This guy I had a thing with

495
00:23:18,370 --> 00:23:19,660
suddenly stopped talking to me.

496
00:23:19,660 --> 00:23:22,320
I'm not really in a position
to do readings right now.

497
00:23:22,320 --> 00:23:23,440
Please.

498
00:23:23,460 --> 00:23:24,530
Help me one more time.

499
00:23:24,530 --> 00:23:26,010
Take a look at this photo for me.

500
00:23:26,010 --> 00:23:27,370
It's really not convenient
for me right now.

501
00:23:27,370 --> 00:23:29,990
-You might have to find someone else.
-Please.

502
00:23:30,090 --> 00:23:32,600
Please? You're the best.

503
00:23:32,630 --> 00:23:34,040
Fine.

504
00:23:36,660 --> 00:23:38,390
He still likes you.

505
00:23:39,420 --> 00:23:41,750
-I'd say he likes you quite a lot.
-Really?

506
00:23:42,790 --> 00:23:45,190
Try reaching out
to him again after a while.

507
00:23:45,290 --> 00:23:46,600
That's a relief.

508
00:23:46,630 --> 00:23:49,410
Is 300 yuan okay this time?

509
00:23:49,430 --> 00:23:52,050
No need, no need.
Let's just call it a chat this time.

510
00:23:52,050 --> 00:23:52,970
-No need...
-No way.

511
00:23:52,970 --> 00:23:54,850
-No need, really.
-You helped me. I must help you.

512
00:23:54,850 --> 00:23:56,230
Really, no need. Just keep it yourself.

513
00:23:56,230 --> 00:23:56,720
It's alright.

514
00:23:56,720 --> 00:23:57,780
Next time I will...

515
00:24:01,120 --> 00:24:03,920
Why did she give you money?

516
00:24:04,290 --> 00:24:05,710
You're doing readings again?

517
00:24:05,710 --> 00:24:06,420
No.

518
00:24:07,970 --> 00:24:09,620
Did he do a psychic reading for you?

519
00:24:09,620 --> 00:24:10,370
Yeah.

520
00:24:13,750 --> 00:24:15,870
Please leave first.

521
00:24:15,870 --> 00:24:18,120
And thanks for your honesty.

522
00:24:24,750 --> 00:24:27,040
It's not what you think.

523
00:24:27,440 --> 00:24:29,440
Perverted College Student,

524
00:24:29,740 --> 00:24:32,280
do you know you're still a suspect?

525
00:24:33,960 --> 00:24:36,590
That's why I tried
to turn her down just now.

526
00:24:37,640 --> 00:24:40,250
Looks like you're coming back
to the station with me.

527
00:24:40,250 --> 00:24:42,380
I'll let your manager know.

528
00:24:43,350 --> 00:24:45,890
I'll tell the manager myself.
She'll get the wrong idea if you tell her.

529
00:24:45,890 --> 00:24:47,160
Please. Please.

530
00:24:59,230 --> 00:25:00,270
The thread...

531
00:25:10,030 --> 00:25:12,910
Am I seeing this right?

532
00:25:12,930 --> 00:25:13,760
What are you doing?

533
00:25:13,760 --> 00:25:14,750
It really is a thread.

534
00:25:14,750 --> 00:25:16,240
My first thread.

535
00:25:16,260 --> 00:25:17,640
What thread?

536
00:25:21,000 --> 00:25:22,800
How could it be connected to you?

537
00:25:24,070 --> 00:25:25,130
What are you doing?

538
00:25:27,540 --> 00:25:30,500
I can't believe I finally
found my connection.

539
00:25:30,950 --> 00:25:33,500
But... how is this possible?
